# BUGS

The history of notices is lost when `notices` stops, and there is no Do not disturb.
The limits are read only when it starts.
There is one drawer, not one a document: clips aren't yet linked to what they were copied for.
A clip's file is written whole when the entry comes, so a 16 MiB entry is read into memory and written at once.
